WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.398
Waraba at the Edge of the Light.

00:00:03.398 --> 00:00:07.948
Ilyas could make a joke about almost anything.

00:00:07.948 --> 00:00:14.082
Loose teeth. Dark rooms. Even the gecko above the cupboard.

00:00:14.082 --> 00:00:19.836
“Are you scared of nothing?” his younger cousin asked.

00:00:19.836 --> 00:00:23.450
“Only boring soup.”

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:28.744
Captain Wobble, his loose tooth, chose supper to mutiny.

00:00:28.744 --> 00:00:34.974
It landed in Ilyas's palm beside one very surprised lentil.

00:00:34.974 --> 00:00:39.860
“Tonight, you may follow our family's old way.”

00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:43.978
She rinsed the tooth and wrapped it carefully.

00:00:43.978 --> 00:00:51.984
“Step beyond the light. Offer it. Ask for a strong new tooth.”

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:55.358
“Will Waraba come?”

00:00:55.358 --> 00:01:01.036
“Obviously. I will demonstrate.”

00:01:01.036 --> 00:01:06.570
At the open door, the kitchen light made a bright rectangle.

00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:13.376
Beyond it waited cooling stones, dry grass, and honest darkness.

00:01:13.376 --> 00:01:18.886
“I will stand here. The step is yours.”

00:01:18.886 --> 00:01:24.060
Ilyas kept both feet inside and threw from the doorway.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:32.114
“Efficient. Aerodynamic. Completely traditional.”

00:01:32.114 --> 00:01:37.480
The tooth landed inside the light and did not disappear.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:43.734
Far away, Waraba opened one amber eye and waited.

00:01:43.734 --> 00:01:48.716
In the morning, the tooth still lay in the dust.

00:01:48.716 --> 00:01:52.042
“Did Waraba come?”

00:01:52.042 --> 00:01:56.808
“He was probably extremely busy.”

00:01:56.808 --> 00:02:01.670
Mother placed the tooth back in his hand without scolding.

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:07.444
“Near is a doorway. It is not the other side.”

00:02:07.444 --> 00:02:11.370
“Were you scared when you did it?”

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:14.360
“The whole way.”

00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:21.334
“My mother waited. Waraba waited. I stepped.”

00:02:21.334 --> 00:02:25.092
The dark had not become smaller for her.

00:02:25.092 --> 00:02:31.418
All day, Ilyas carried the tooth and his unfinished truth.

00:02:31.418 --> 00:02:36.112
“I did not really go beyond the light.”

00:02:36.112 --> 00:02:40.206
“Do you want me to wait at the door?”

00:02:40.206 --> 00:02:46.460
Ilyas had expected teasing. The kindness felt surprisingly brave.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:52.498
That evening, Mother and Cousin stood inside the warm doorway.

00:02:52.498 --> 00:02:57.432
Nobody counted for Ilyas. Nobody pushed.

00:02:57.432 --> 00:03:01.982
One foot crossed the edge. Then the other.

00:03:01.982 --> 00:03:07.108
“I prepared several heroic noises.”

00:03:07.108 --> 00:03:12.330
Fear walked beside him instead of blocking the path.

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:18.392
A warm stone rested beneath his sandal. He breathed slowly.

00:03:18.392 --> 00:03:22.966
The doorway became a small amber shape behind him.

00:03:22.966 --> 00:03:34.764
“Waraba, this is my tooth. I marked the paper with the two steps I chose. Please bring a strong new one.”

00:03:34.764 --> 00:03:43.874
He wrapped the tooth inside his two-footstep drawing, threw, then waited without chasing the silence with a joke.

00:03:43.874 --> 00:03:48.640
Two amber eyes opened low across the ground.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:55.566
Waraba stepped forward, enormous, spotted, and unhurried.

00:03:55.566 --> 00:04:01.652
His mouth stayed closed. His warm eyes asked no performance.

00:04:01.652 --> 00:04:12.946
Waraba breathed over the little drawing. Tooth, two brave footsteps, and Ilyas's exact path gathered into one warm Toothlight.

00:04:12.946 --> 00:04:19.080
Then he received the Toothlight as gently as Mother had held the tooth.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:27.974
A smooth warm stone appeared beside Ilyas's foot while Waraba kept the two-footstep Toothlight safe.

00:04:27.974 --> 00:04:36.244
Tanda followed the quiet gold path only far enough to witness the promise. She did not interrupt it.

00:04:36.244 --> 00:04:43.365
Ilyas walked back to the warm doorway. Mother asked, “Were you scared?”

00:04:43.365 --> 00:04:55.599
“Yes. And I went anyway.” Fear was still real, but now the Toothlight kept the exact two steps that proved his courage.
